om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Standalone shared-referee interface gate. Compile with om2 header.
note verify RUN BENCH OMC CHAT OUT release|test
note Fixed path arrays implement Linux PATH_MAX, not a dataset size limit. Data streams.
text vxnull "/dev/null"
